<title>MALAYSIA: Rahman Hydraulic to buy stake.</title>
<headline>Rahman Hydraulic to buy stake.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rahman Hydraulic Tin Bd said on Friday that it was in talks to buy an equity interest in another company.</p>
<p>In a statement, the commodities and property firm did not disclose the name of the company. But it said that further details on the deal would be released &quot;as soon as the terms have been finalised&quot;. -- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
</text>
